    "what_is_stu_follow_up": "What is the Basma App ?",
    "stu_follow_up_ans": "It is an application that aims to improve the school work environment, as it allows the school administration to directly monitor the status of the student during school hours, providing a variety of services that help teachers to perform their entrusted tasks to reduce administrative burdens and raise the level of their performance within the classroom, which is reflected positively on the level of achievement The student’s academic studies and reduce the financial burdens on the guardian through private lessons and others. The system also allows providing an innovative mechanism to assess the student’s behavioral and educational level, and a supervisory partnership between the educational institution and the student’s guardian contributes to reducing negative phenomena inside the school building and preparing a generation of young people who are aware of their personality, maker of their identity and contributor to achieving the national vision.",
